{"4317950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rasta Santa", "steam_appid": 4317950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Lagos. Christmas Day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The city is silent, but the streets are screaming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rasta Santa</strong> is an uncompromising 2D action-platformer that blends high-octane shoot-and-slash combat with a raw, culturally grounded narrative. Step into the boots of a relentless enforcer on a mission to dismantle a child-trafficking ring operating in the shadows of Lagos. This isn’t the Santa you grew up with it’s a legend forged through skill, grit, and consequence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CITY THAT LOOKS AWAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The children are missing. The law is silent. As Rasta Santa, fight your way through gang-controlled districts, floating slums, and urban warzones.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid</strong> hideouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> high-speed chases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend</strong> the orphanage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront</strong> the kingpins.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Combat:</strong> Seamlessly switch between heavy-hitting firearm and machete. Dash through gunfire and chain attacks in fluid encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions:</strong> Experience high-pressure chase sequences and defensive &quot;hold-the-line&quot; battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School Heart:</strong> “Tough-but-fair” arcade difficulty with responsive modern controls and explosive visual feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 